  "id": "lambda-model",
  "term": "lambda model",
  "definition": "In this context, the lambda model is a regression-based model built from passive-stretch sensor data to derive biomarkers related to the neurogenic component of muscle spasticity. Its outputs were used to help estimate a spasticity rating comparable in meaning to the modified Ashworth scale grade.",
